{"s":60,"v":[{"t":"O you who have believed, do not take My enemies and your enemies as allies, extending to them affection while they have disbelieved in what came to you of the truth, having driven out the Prophet and yourselves [only] because you believe in Allāh, your Lord. If you have come out for jihād [i.e., fighting or striving] in My cause and seeking means to My approval, [take them not as friends]. You confide to them affection [i.e., instruction], but I am most knowing of what you have concealed and what you have declared. And whoever does it among you has certainly strayed from the soundness of the way.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","who","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تَتَّخِذُوا۟","take","tattakhidhū","",[["تَتَّخِذُ",114],["وا۟",4]]],["عَدُوِّى","My enemies","ʿaduwwī","",[["عَدُوِّ",245],["ى",20]]],["وَعَدُوَّكُمْ","and your enemies","waʿaduwwakum","",[["وَ",1],["عَدُوَّ",245],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَوْلِيَآءَ","(as) allies","awliyāa",""],["تُلْقُونَ","offering","tul'qūna","",[["تُلْقُ",180],["ونَ",4]]],["إِلَيْهِم","them","ilayhim","",[["إِلَيْ",26],["هِم",3]]],["بِٱلْمَوَدَّةِ","love","bil-mawadati","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["مَوَدَّةِ",999]]],["وَقَدْ","while","waqad","",[["وَ",1],["قَدْ",37]]],["كَفَرُوا۟","they have disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["بِمَا","in what","bimā","",[["بِ",10],["مَا",12]]],["جَآءَكُم","came to you","jāakum","",[["جَآءَ",57],["كُم",4]]],["مِّنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلْحَقِّ","the truth","l-ḥaqi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَقِّ",64]]],["يُخْرِجُونَ","driving out","yukh'rijūna","",[["يُخْرِجُ",131],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱلرَّسُولَ","the Messenger","l-rasūla","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّسُولَ",47]]],["وَإِيَّاكُمْ","and yourselves","wa-iyyākum","ۙ",[["وَ",1],["إِيَّاكُمْ",441]]],["أَن","because","an",""],["تُؤْمِنُوا۟","you believe","tu'minū","",[["تُؤْمِنُ",30],["وا۟",4]]],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah"